B.bgm=s(["**Cloud Firestore:** regi\xe3o `southamerica-east1` (S\xe3o Paulo, Brasil).","Backups e logs operacionais do Firebase podem ser processados em outras regi\xf5es da Google Cloud com base nas Standard Contractual Clauses, o que cobre eventuais transfer\xeancias internacionais sob a LGPD (Art. 33, II) e o GDPR (Art. 46).","Dados locais ficam apenas no seu dispositivo (Keychain/Keystore + SharedPreferences)."],t.s)
B.afm=new A.di(B.bgm,!1)
B.beY=s(["App lock PIN (only **SHA-256 hash + salt** in Keychain/Keystore \u2014 never sent to any server)","Lock flags (PIN active, biometrics active)","UI preferences (currency, language, theme, dashboard layout, hidden wallets, financial literacy level)"],t.s)
B.afn=new A.di(B.beY,!1)
B.bff=s(["Que o app estar\xe1 livre de erros ou interrup\xe7\xf5es","Que os c\xe1lculos e relat\xf3rios sejam precisos para fins fiscais ou cont\xe1beis","Resultados financeiros espec\xedficos a partir do uso do app"],t.s)
B.afo=new A.di(B.bff,!1)
B.bhi=s(["Providing truthful information and keeping it up to date","Maintaining the confidentiality of your password","All activity that occurs in your account","Notifying us immediately of any unauthorized use"],t.s)
